  "changes": [
    "Rounded proximal oral axes divide into selected paired distal branches; finer attached folded exteriors replace eight broad ribbon plates",
    "Varied short white/violet expanded club heads on slender pale pedicles, plus selected longer appendages; fewer identical spherical tips",
    "Rounder crown/dome/rim, original irregular brown-ivory oral fields and subtle radial bell relief; depth handling prevents rear tissues painting over front surfaces",
    "Finite eight-second same-model local deformation with fixed central dome, flexible distal margin, bounded attached oral motion, recovery and exact neutral hold"
